  they are already here try to get no new  ones and the ones that are over the five  six maybe seven years here let them stay  it's not good what will you say that  they have to go back then you have to  send them back but don't let them stay  here they're not good how wonderful to  see him nice to see it is how are you  Mariama couldn't survive without  volunteer helpers like my own sacks a  political scientist she visits the  squatters regularly bringing medicine  when someone's ill but also helping them  find their next shelter Mariama doesn't  understand why the Dutch authorities  treat her so badly if I don't have a  place and they know that they should  give me a place because shelter is not  something that I have to ask it's  something that I'm entitled to it's my  right so if they are not giving and I  try to take it then I don't know why  they have to criminalize me they think  that if they can make the situation very  bad that then you will return and now  it's been proven already for quite a  long time that you well the people who  cannot return are not returning they're  just in very destitute and very bad  circumstances in the street that the  Holland that has been in the past  liberal and and open country has become  very very right-wing and very  conservative and scary in the evening  the refugees hold a kind of conference  and what used to be a government  conference room an attorney is on home  to give free advice she sees only one  way forward the refugees should file new  applications for asylum with additional  evidence to prove they were really  persecuted it's an exhausting  bureaucratic ordeal  this is a declaration or statement that  you don't have any income mm-hmm and if  we send it to the court you don't have  to pay the courts that's the only thing  so what you need then after her five  year long experience with the  authorities  Mariama omar sees no prospects in the  netherlands if i had a choice i will go  back to my country I'll go back to my  cats leaving tomorrow  well it's not possible well I don't have  that choice the situation is similar for  the other refugees here as well but  Holland's harsh Asylum policies have  little deterrent effect and more and  more refugees keep arriving
 

